<newsitem itemid="22721" id="root" date="1996-08-29" xml:lang="en">
<title>NETHERLANDS: Frans Maas H1 net profit grows.</title>
<headline>Frans Maas H1 net profit grows.</headline>
<dateline>VENLO, Netherlands 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.69 vs   1.72</p>
<p>    Net profit			    13.9  vs   8.7</p>
<p>    Turnover			     619.0  vs 607.6</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    28.2  vs 23.2</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Koninklijke Frans Maas Groep NV.  </p>
<p>    Interest charges		     5.9  vs   7.7</p>
<p>    Tax					8.0  vs   6.5</p>
<p>    Minorities charge		    0.4  vs   0.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Road transport group Frans Maas is 32 percent owned by flag carrier KLM Royal Dutch airlines.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
